ral-01",{"sectionTitle":28,"sectionDescription":28,"linksStyle":77},"primary","feature_link_cards_promo$7e4db268-ee42-47b3-9e92-ca228e235926","feature_link_cards_promo",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":81,"primary":83,"id":121,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":28},[82],{},{"CardImage":84,"CardAvatar":91,"CardTitle":92,"CardText":93,"ButtonText":116,"ButtonUrl":117,"IsEco":45},{"dimensions":85,"alt":28,"copyright":28,"url":88,"id":89,"edit":90},{"width":86,"height":87},1920,1080,"international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F94a05482-5519-4dcc-81b3-7332e50ee1ea_Barnsley+Image.jpg?auto=compress,format","ZGSbvxEAACIA9D2b",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"none","Send from A to everywhere",[94,97,101,104,107,110,113],{"type":25,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":57},"When we launched Evri we invested £11 million in our international business. With delivery to more than 250 countries and territories, an expanding network of global partners and the biggest pick-up and drop-off estate in Europe, we’ll help you reach more customers.",[],{"type":98,"text":99,"spans":100,"direction":57},"list-item","Deliver to over 220 countries and territories worldwide",[],{"type":98,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":57},"100+ partners globally",[],{"type":98,"text":105,"spans":106,"direction":57},"The largest pick-up and drop-off estate across Europe (115,000+ locations)",[],{"type":98,"text":108,"spans":109,"direction":57},"We work with reputable and efficient clearance brokers to ensure a good speed of service",[],{"type":98,"text":111,"spans":112,"direction":57},"A global presence – we have dedicated facilities in UK, US & Europe – with more coming",[],{"type":25,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":57}," ",[],"Enquire today",{"link_type":118,"key":119,"url":120},"Web","0e62c2dd-3911-4270-8caa-800603903565","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbusiness\u002Fenquiry-form\u002Fbusiness-details","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":124,"primary":126,"id":142,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":28},[125],{},{"CardImage":127,"CardAvatar":91,"CardTitle":136,"CardText":137,"ButtonText":28,"ButtonUrl":141,"IsEco":45},{"dimensions":128,"alt":131,"copyright":28,"url":132,"id":133,"edit":134},{"width":129,"height":130},1000,665,"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling at the customer and handing a blue receipt to confirm that their parcel has been accepted.","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2730.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq",{"x":135,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":65},38,"Tailor-made solutions",[138],{"type":25,"text":139,"spans":140},"Because all businesses are different, we don’t believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. And with dramatic changes in the global e-commerce regulatory landscape over the last 12 months, international shipping can be tricky to navigate. That’s why we’ll work with you to support your unique needs. You’ll get all the benefits of our experience as the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company – benefits which you can then pass on to your customers.",[],{"link_type":30},"card$8d348772-9571-455b-b5d4-487455a61b70",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":144,"primary":146,"id":160,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":28},[145],{},{"CardImage":147,"CardAvatar":91,"CardTitle":154,"CardText":155,"ButtonText":28,"ButtonUrl":159,"IsEco":45},{"dimensions":148,"alt":149,"copyright":28,"url":150,"id":151,"edit":152},{"width":129,"height":130},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":40,"y":153,"zoom":41,"background":65},8,"We’ll help you grow your business",[156],{"type":25,"text":157,"spans":158},"We’re helping retailers extend their international reach. With warehouses across the world and an omni-channel fulfilment strategy in place to ensure seamless and speedy deliveries, we’ll offer all the support you need as you grow.",[],{"link_type":30},"card$9f911619-c216-4739-8b7d-6076ef065c29",{"variation":162,"version":17,"items":163,"primary":209,"id":212,"slice_type":213,"slice_label":28},"listComponent",[164,173,182,191,200],{"title":165,"content":166,"icon":167},"We deliver to over 220 countries and territories worldwide",[],{"dimensions":168,"alt":169,"copyright":28,"url":170,"id":171,"edit":172},{"width":60,"height":60},"Location icon","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8ee71b91-4c7d-4419-a907-ef6a4f89d913_location+pin.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsP",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},{"title":174,"content":175,"icon":176},"Localised notifications",[],{"dimensions":177,"alt":178,"copyright":28,"url":179,"id":180,"edit":181},{"width":60,"height":60},"Phone icon","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},{"title":183,"content":184,"icon":185},"Full end-to-end client tracking with logo personalisation",[],{"dimensions":186,"alt":187,"copyright":28,"url":188,"id":189,"edit":190},{"width":60,"height":60},"Track location icon","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},{"title":192,"content":193,"icon":194},"Guaranteed liability available",[],{"dimensions":195,"alt":196,"copyright":28,"url":197,"id":198,"edit":199},{"width":60,"height":60},"Icon of a broken parcel","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F85a05552-9f40-436d-b9e9-fb8788696314_not_handled_with_care.svg","YflB_hEAACAA8pcV",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},{"title":201,"content":202,"icon":203},"Dual partner strategy ensures best in country carriers deliver your parcels",[],{"dimensions":204,"alt":205,"copyright":28,"url":206,"id":207,"edit":208},{"width":60,"height":60},"Icon of a parcel","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},{"theme":21,"title":210,"description":211},"We make it easy to deliver locally","We’ve invested in cutting-edge APIs to launch new integrated cross border end-to-end services and products. We’re also developing a network of reliable local partners to ensure parcels move smoothly between territories.","list_block$4635badb-5f58-431f-ad27-ad71149c8c4d","list_block",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":215,"primary":217,"id":234,"slice_type":235,"slice_label":28},[216],{},{"title":218,"bodyText":219,"isEco":45,"PaddingTop":45,"PaddingBottom":226,"NoMarginBottom":45,"hasButton":45,"buttonText":28,"buttonLink":227,"image":228},"Market-leading PUDO proposition",[220,223],{"type":25,"text":221,"spans":222},"We’re constantly growing our pick-up and drop-off estate at home and abroad. As well as giving you more shipping options, your customers will enjoy unbeatable convenience.",[],{"type":98,"text":224,"spans":225},"115,000+ PUDO locations in Europe and 200,000+ globally",[],true,{"link_type":30},{"dimensions":229,"alt":230,"copyright":28,"url":231,"id":232,"edit":233},{"width":129,"height":130},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","international-business-shipping.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C